<title>USA: Health and Retirement buys 25 buildings.</title>
<headline>Health and Retirement buys 25 buildings.</headline>
<dateline>NEWTON, Mass. 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Health and Retirement Properties Trust said Thursday it completed the acquisition of 25 office buildings leased to the U.S. Government for $394 million.</p>
<p>On February 17, HRP announced that it had signed an agreement to acquire 30 office buildings, which are leased to various agencies of the U.S. Government for about $446 million.</p>
<p>The remaining five properties are expected to be acquired over the course of the next year, with two expected to be acquired within the next month, the company said.</p>
</text>
